Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:50:08 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 411/417] Translations (ja): BIM, CAM and FEM, every string
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The 2,902 strings left (BIM 1,666, CAM 1,031, FEM 205): no unfinished
Japanese translation is left in any module. Terms as the existing ones
(壁, 窓, 構造体, ストック, ステップオーバー, ドレスアップ, メッシュ再分割…);
Site 敷地 and Building 建物 throughout BIM (the file had サイト, 用地 and
敷地). Kept English: product, format, controller and solver names,
G-codes, and names the code matches (enum values, quoted properties).
BIM's and App's compiled translations in the sources are made again
(App's was older than its .ts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
